    <p><span style="font-weight: 400;"><strong>One of the main tasks</strong> of this organization is to supply military resources to other law enforcement state structures.</span><span style="font-weight: 400;"> It's crucial to protect these military resources and prevent criminal elements from removing them from the base's territory. The responsibilities of the military also include responding to emergencies in the state.</span></p>

    <p><span style="font-weight: 400;"><strong>To join</strong> the National Guard, you need to arrive at the specified location, which will be announced in advance through state news. You must have your passport, medical certificate, and a driver's license of category <strong>B</strong> and <strong>C</strong> with you.</span></p>
