    <p><span style="font-weight: 400;"><font size="6"><strong>AirDrop</strong></font> - is a system of airdrops in a separate world, which are dropped in random locations. Each airdrop contains a variety of valuable items! AirDrop is designed for you if you are very skilled, proficient in shooting, and can devise cool tactics with your team!<br /><br /></span><span style="font-weight: 400;"></span></p>
    <blockquote>
        <p>
            <center>
                <strong>One AirDrop can contain:</strong><br /><span style="font-weight: 400;">A large amount of weaponry, ranging from revolvers to sniper rifles, and rare melee weapons.</span>
<span style="font-weight: 400;"><br /></span><span style="font-weight: 400;">At least 5,000 materials.</span><span style="font-weight: 400;"><br /></span><span style="font-weight: 400;">At least 100 medical kits.</span>
<span style="font-weight: 400;"><br /></span><span style="font-weight: 400;">At least 20 body armors.</span><span style="font-weight: 400;"><br /></span>
<span style="font-weight: 400;">Unique masks or random masks from cases.<br />
Coupons for vehicles, including those from Elite AutoRoom.<br />
</span>
            </center>
        </p>
        <br />
        <p>
            <span style="font-weight: 400;">
                There can be between 1 to 4 crates in total. To break into the crates, a military lockpick is required, and the more you have, the better! Payment is made upfront for the entire faction / family. This means that if one member of the faction / family purchases something, all other members of the faction / family can also participate!<br />
                <br />
            </span>
            <span style="font-weight: 400;"></span>
            <span style="font-weight: 400;">
