    <p><span style="font-weight: 400;">An excellent opportunity for some initial earnings as a newcomer. The job is not dirty, and it doesn't require licenses or experience.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">After getting hired, you need to go to the lawnmower parking lot (<strong>M -&gt; Jobs -&gt; Lawnmower Parking</strong>). To get there, you can try asking people standing near the mayor's office for a ride to work, or you can rent a vehicle nearby.</span></p>

<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">After arriving at the lawnmower parking lot, you <strong>need to walk to an available lawnmower and sit in it</strong>. After that, a window will appear where you need to confirm the lawnmower rental.</span></p>
