<div class="text">
    <p><span style="font-weight: 400;">If your body is accustomed to long periods of sleep deprivation and you can also maintain concentration and stay attentive on the road, then this job is for you.</span></p>
    <p><span style="font-weight: 400;">After getting employed, you need to exit the town hall and use the navigator on your phone, selecting &laquo;<strong>GPS &gt; Work &gt; Parking truckers</strong>&raquo;.</span></p>
    <p><span style="font-weight: 400;">After arriving at the parking lot, proceed to the available vehicle and enter it. After that, you will be prompted to rent it. To open the menu with orders, you need to enter the command;<strong>/orders</strong>&rdquo; and choose a preferred order, which you will need to pick up from the warehouse and deliver to the customer.</span></p>
    <p><span style="font-weight: 400;"><strong>Requirements</strong>: category rights &ldquo;<strong>C</strong>&rdquo;<br /></span><span style="font-weight: 400;"><strong>Salary</strong>: from 800$ to 3.500$</span></p>
    <p><span style="font-weight: 400;"><strong>Teams</strong>:</span></p>
    <p><span style="font-weight: 400;"><strong>/orders</strong> - open the menu with order selection (works only at the loading point of goods)<br />Interaction markers have been added at the loading points of goods, which also open the order menu.<br /></span><strong>/t</strong> - radio truckers.<br /><strong>/findtrailer</strong> - If you have lost your trailer, this command will help you find it.<br /><strong>/mypoint</strong> - With the help of this command, you can find out where you need to deliver the cargo.</p>
