<div class="text">
    <p>
        <center><font size="5">HeliCrash refers to the crash of a military or rescue helicopter at a random location within the state, of which there are more than 50 in quantity.</font></center>
        <br />
        <center>
            <strong>How it works?</strong><br />
            <br />

            <span style="font-weight: 400;">
                "The system is available to all players and operates from 12:00 PM to 12:00 AM. Every hour, approximately at 45 minutes past the hour, the system sends a notification in the chat that a helicopter, which is transmitting a distress signal, will soon fly over the state. Ten minutes after such a notification, the helicopter crashes, and a real battle for crates with valuable drops begins!<br><br>
A Radio Interceptor will help you locate the helicopter; it will provide the exact crash area. You can purchase it on the black market (don't forget to get some military lockpicks there as well; they will come in handy!). The helicopter releases a lot of smoke, which can be seen from several hundred meters away!<br><br>"
                <br />
            </span>
            <span style="font-weight: 400;">
                With each crash, three crates appear around the helicopter, which can be unlocked with a military lockpick. The contents of the crates vary depending on the type of helicopter. For example, military crates might contain body armor, materials, rare specialized weapons, while rescue crates could hold first aid kits, masks, and an especially rare item - Epinephrine, which, when used, can revive a player with a 100% chance.<br><br>
All actions take place in the main world, so there's a chance to encounter someone else and engage in a battle for the acquired loot. The DM (Deathmatch) rules do not apply to this system. If you arrive at the crash site or are nearby when the crash happens, you automatically become a participant in this event, and you can be killed.<br><br><br>
We wish you good luck in finding the helicopter, capturing the crates, and may the strongest prevail!<br>
            </span>
        </center>
    </p>
