    <p><span style="font-weight: 400;"><strong>Private company</strong>, which often operates under contract with the Government, providing them with support through their high-quality equipment.. <strong>The main goal</strong> The organization's role involves providing security for events/personalities, etc., with whom the organization has a contract&nbsp;</span></p>
    <p><span style="font-weight: 400;"><strong>The organization is involved in patrolling the highway around the city of Los Santos, or assisting LSPD / FIB personnel upon their requests in various tasks.&nbsp;</span></p>
    <p><span style="font-weight: 400;"><strong>MWS</strong> They also have with them <strong>handcuffs</strong> and <strong>various specialized equipment.</strong>, that are used for apprehending individuals who have committed offenses. By working in this faction, you will be able to provide significant support to our state, where law and order prevail.</span></p>
    <p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Commands/keys</span></p>
