<div class="text">
    <p><span style="font-weight: 400;">You are presented with opportunities to engage in activities outside the law <strong>Abduction of people</strong>, <strong>robbery</strong>, <strong>the uk</strong>, <strong>War for businesses</strong>, <strong>Weapon trade</strong>. You can fully embody a mafia member, whether tough, resolute, or kind and just. The choice is yours, and there are many paths available</span></p>
    <p><span style="font-weight: 400;">In total, you can find 4 mafia groups in the state: <strong>Russian Mafia</strong>, <strong>Yakuza</strong>, <strong>La Cosa Nostra</strong>, <strong>Armenian Mafia</strong>. Some of them might form alliances, while others engage in fierce rivalries.</span></p>
    <p><span style="font-weight: 400;">One of the main tasks of each mafia is - <strong>controlling the largest number of businesses in the state.</strong>, For each business under the mafia's control, they receive <em>90</em>$. Also for everyone <strong>The mafia is necessary</strong>&nbsp;actively engage in conflicts with government organizations, disrupting their supply of materials and medications, and eventually taking them for themselves</span></p>
    <p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Illegal items that assist in robberies, kidnappings, and other criminal activities can be purchased on the "<strong>Black Market</strong>".</span></p>
    <p><span style="font-weight: 400;"><strong>Recruitment</strong> into the mafia occurs through posting advertisements. If you have the desire to join one, remember that you must fully comply with its internal rules.</span></p>
    
    <p><strong>Commands</strong>
        <br /><strong>/follow</strong> - lead behind
        <br /><strong>/openstock</strong> - open the warehouse
        <br /><strong>/closestock</strong> - close the warehouse
        <br /><strong>/bizwar</strong> - initiate a business takeover
        <br /><strong>/tpbizwar</strong> - teleport to the business war zone</p>
        
