<div class="text">
    When in a gang, new opportunities and entirely new types of activities become available to you, most of which are often prohibited by the law. Among them, you will find: <strong>robberies</strong>, <strong>carjackings</strong>, <strong>territory wars</strong>, <strong>arms and narcotics trade</strong>.

    <p><span style="font-weight: 400;">In total, you can find 5 gangs in the state: <strong>Blood Street Gang</strong>, <strong>The Families</strong>, <strong>The Ballas Gang</strong>, <strong>Los Santos Vagos</strong>, <strong>Marabunta Grande</strong>. Just like the mafia, some of them can form alliances, while others engage in fierce wars.</span></p>
    <p><span style="font-weight: 400;">One of the main goals of each gang is to <strong>control the largest number of territories</strong>, and they receive $90 for each one. This is why there are territorial wars between gangs. Once a war starts, the main objective of a gang is to eliminate all of its opponents.</span></p>

<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Illegal items that assist in robberies, kidnappings, and other criminal activities can be purchased by gang members on the "<strong>Black Market</strong>".</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;"><strong>Recruitment</strong> into gangs occurs through posting advertisements. If you have the desire to join one, remember that you must fully comply with its internal rules.</span></p>
    <p><strong>Teams</strong>
        <br /><strong>/follow</strong> - lead behind
<br /><strong>/openstock</strong> - open the warehouse
<br /><strong>/closestock</strong> - close the warehouse
<br /><strong>/capture</strong> - initiate territory capture
<br /><strong>/tpcapture</strong> - teleport to the capture zone</p>

