<div class="text">
    <p><span style="font-weight: 400;">A great opportunity to help residents and newcomers, make numerous new acquaintances, learn more about what's happening in the state, and beyond..</span></p>
    <p><span style="font-weight: 400;">After getting hired, you need to exit the town hall and use the navigator on your phone, selecting <strong>GPS &gt; Jobs &gt; Taxi Park</strong>. Upon arriving at the taxi park, you'll need to choose a suitable car (<strong>one of the 4 classes</strong>), then sit in it and rent it.</span></p>

    <p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Cost of taxi rental and fare rates:</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;"><strong>Econom</strong> - $184 rental, fare: $5 - $50;<br /></span><strong>Comfort</strong> - $720, fare: $20 - $100;<br /><strong>Business</strong> - $2880, fare: $80 - $400;<br /><strong>Ultima</strong> - $5760, fare: $160 - $800.</p>
<p>In the taxi menu located in your phone, you can find comprehensive information about each order, such as the distance to the passenger or their name.</p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;"><strong>Requirements</strong>: Category &ldquo;<strong>B</strong>&rdquo; driver's license</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;"><strong>Commands</strong>:</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;"><strong>/ta [ID]</strong> - accept a call from a person<br /></span><strong>/tprice [ID] [Amount]</strong> - issue a fare invoice to the client</p>

    <p></p>

