  <p>
    <span style="font-weight: 400;"><span style="font-weight: 400;">Being a mailman requires a good knowledge of the area, as without it, they won't be able to deliver packages quickly and earn a lot.</span>
    $$$.</span>
  </p>
  <p>
  <span style="font-weight: 400;">After getting hired, head to the post office (<strong>M -&gt; Jobs -&gt; Post Office</strong>). You can use the taxi service for this or rent a car near the town hall.</span>

  </p>
  <p>
    <span style="font-weight: 400;"><p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Upon arriving at the post office, go to the marker near the door and press "E". This will open your phone, where you can start or finish your job and also pick up additional parcels.</span></p>
    .</span>
  </p>
  <p>
    <span style="font-weight: 400;">After starting the job, you need to go to the marker labeled "<strong>Get work vehicle</strong>", it will appear, and you'll be able to deliver parcels. You also have the option to deliver parcels using your personal vehicle and even with friends.</span>

  </p>
  <p>
    <span style="font-weight: 400;">
      <strong>Requirements</strong>: category rights &ldquo; <strong>B</strong>&rdquo; <br />
    </span>
    <span style="font-weight: 400;">
      <strong>Salary</strong>: about $ 200 per hour of work. <br />
    </span>
    <span style="font-weight: 400;">
      <strong>Bonuses</strong>: For this job, additional salary bonuses apply with VIP status. &nbsp; </span>
  </p>
  <p>
