<div class="text">
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;"><strong>Faction</strong> that includes the <strong>judicial</strong>, <strong>executive</strong>, and <strong>legislative</strong> branches of government. Engaged in creating laws, making important decisions regarding the entire state, organizing events, and financing various sectors within the state.</span></p>

<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">You can become a <strong>secretary</strong>, <strong>governor's security</strong>, <strong>judge</strong>, <strong>prosecutor</strong>, <strong>secret service agent</strong>, or <strong>even the governor</strong> - your possibilities are limited only by your potential.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">It holds the <strong>management of all</strong> government services. The attire of employees primarily consists of business-style clothing, and for secret service agents, it's a standard black uniform. The <strong>vehicle fleet</strong> consists of cars for official trips and is painted in white.</span></p>

<p><span style="font-weight: 400;"><strong>To join</strong> the government, you need a passport and a medical card. Typically, employment takes place at the government building (City Hall), and this is announced in advance through state news.</span></p>

    <p><strong>Buttons</strong>
        <br><span style="font-weight: 400;"><strong>X</strong> - Remove/put handcuffs<br /></span><strong>Z</strong> - To lead<br>
        <strong> "G" > Faction > Search</strong> - Search for things from the player <br>
            <p><strong>Teams</strong>
                <br /><strong>/incar</strong> - put a violator in a car
                <br /><strong>/pull</strong> - eject a player from a car
                <br /><strong>/takegunlic</strong> - confiscate a gun license
                <br /><strong>/su</strong> - initiate a person's search warrant
                <br /><strong>/ticket</strong> - issue a fine
                <br /><strong>/go</strong> - accept a player's call</p>
                
            
