<div class="text">
    <p><span style="font-weight: 400;">In the state, there are <strong>families</strong> and <strong>unofficial organizations</strong>. Only families can be created, while the status of an unofficial organization needs to be obtained, but more on that later... A family is created near the <strong>Eclipse Tower</strong> building, where the office itself is located.</span></p>
    <p><span style="font-weight: 400;">The player creating a family must have <strong>at least the first level</strong> and <strong>$250,000</strong> on hand, as well as <strong>not have active warnings</strong>.</span><span style="font-weight: 400;"><br /></span></p>

    <p><span style="font-weight: 400;"><strong>After creating</strong> the family, all players will receive a corresponding message in the global chat with the name of your family. You will have an <strong>office</strong> and a <strong>garage</strong> at your disposal with the possibility of further upgrades. Additionally, a family chat /fc /fcb will be available, along with rank configuration and the possibility to <strong>join factions!</strong></span></p>

    <p><span style="font-weight: 400;"><strong>List of improvements:</strong></span></p>
    <p><span style="font-weight: 400;">You can purchase a <strong>personal workshop</strong> for <em>$75,000</em>, where you'll be able to tune your organization's vehicles at government prices.<br /><br /></span><span style="font-weight: 400;"><strong>Buy a warehouse</strong> for <em>$50,000</em>, where you'll be able to store medical supplies, materials, weapons, and illicit substances.<br /><br /></span><span style="font-weight: 400;"><strong>Upgrade the office</strong> to level 2 or 3, each level <strong>enhances the interior</strong> and <strong>opens 5 additional garage spaces</strong>.<br /><br /></span><span style="font-weight: 400;"><strong>Purchase weapon blueprints</strong>, the cost of blueprints starts from <em>$5,000 and goes up to $20,000</em>; by obtaining blueprints, members of your organization will be able to craft the corresponding weapons.<br /><br /></span></p>
    
    <p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Now let's turn to the <strong>unofficial organization</strong> aspect. Obtaining this status isn't as simple as it seems; you need to have a roster, post an SS (screenshot situation) on the forum, demonstrate significant activity on the server, and have no major violations on your account. Once your SS is approved, you will automatically receive the new status! Afterward, you'll gain access to abilities such as:</span><span style="font-weight: 400;"> <strong><em>stealing weapons</em>, <em>putting a bag over your head</em>, <em>leading a player</em>, <em>using ties</em>, <em>crafting ammunition</em>, <em>robbing houses and cars</em>.<br /><br /></strong></span><span style="font-weight: 400;"><strong>Additionally</strong>, if you're interested in establishing a comprehensive RP organization, it's advisable to review the topic "<strong>Rules for Unofficial Organizations</strong>" on our forum!</span></p>
</div>