<script>
    import image from '../../images/mech.jpg'
	import image2 from '../../images/mech2.png'
    export let onWayPoint;
</script>

<div class="text">
    <p><span style="font-weight: 400;">If you love tinkering with car engines, have a good understanding of it, and can work quickly, then this job is definitely for you.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">After getting hired, you need to exit the town hall and use the navigator on your phone. Select &ldquo;<strong>GPS &gt; Jobs &gt; Mechanic Shop</strong>&rdquo;. Upon arriving at the mechanic shop, walk to an available car and sit in it. You will then be prompted to rent the car.</span></p>

<p><span style="font-weight: 400;">If you want to <strong>not only repair vehicles but also refuel them</strong>, you need to buy fuel at any of the available gas stations.</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;"><strong>Salary</strong>: from $5 to $30</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;"><strong>Commands</strong>:</span></p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;"><strong>/repair [ID] [Price]</strong> - offer a player to repair their vehicle.<br /></span><strong>/sellfuel [ID] [Amount of Liters] [Price per Liter]</strong> - offer a player to refuel their vehicle.<br /><strong>/buyfuel [Amount]</strong> - buy fuel, this command is only used at gas stations.<br /><strong>/ma [ID]</strong> - accept a call.</p>


    <div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column;"><img src={image} alt="News" class="contentImg"/><img src={image2} alt="News" class="contentImg"/></div>

    <div class="button aligncenter">
        <div class="btn" on:click={onWayPoint}>Show on the map <span class="icon map"/></div>
    </div>
</div>