<div class="text">
    <p><span style="font-weight: 400;">A government service that functions as a regulatory body. They monitor the enforcement of state laws, oversee public events, and even manage road situations.&nbsp;</span></p>

    <p><span style="font-weight: 400;">By joining the police force, you will be able to maintain order on the streets of the city, undertake especially dangerous missions, and investigate mysterious and unusual crimes</span></p>
    <p><span style="font-weight: 400;">Police department personnel <strong>assist</strong> other government factions by <strong>delivering supplies and medications</strong> to their bases and frequently <strong>conduct raids</strong> in criminal areas of the city.</span></p>
    <p><span style="font-weight: 400;"><strong>To join</strong> the ranks of law enforcement officers, you need to come for an interview at the main office of the Police Department. You must have a medical card with a stamp certifying that you are healthy.</span></p>
    <p><strong>Buttons</strong>
    <br><span style="font-weight: 400;">&ldquo;<strong>U</strong>&rdquo;- On-board computer&nbsp;<br /></span>&ldquo;<strong>X</strong>&rdquo; - Put on handcuffs on a person
        <br />&ldquo;<strong>Z</strong>&rdquo; - Lead a person<br></p>
        <p><strong>Teams</strong>
            <br /><strong>/m</strong> - use a megaphone
            <br /><strong>/su</strong> - initiate a person's search warrant
            <br /><strong>/rfp</strong> - release a person from prison
            <br /><strong>/incar</strong> - put a person in a car
            <br /><strong>/pull</strong> - pull a person out of a car
            <br /><strong>/opengs</strong> - open warehouse #2
            <br /><strong>/closegs</strong> - close warehouse #2
            <br /><strong>/pd</strong> - accept a player's call
            <br /><strong>/to</strong> - accept CODE 0
            <br /><strong>/arrest</strong> - place a player in a cell
            <br /><strong>/givegunlic</strong> - issue a gun license
            <br /><strong>/takegunlic</strong> - confiscate a gun license
            <br /><strong>/ticket</strong> - issue a fine
            <br /><strong>/warg</strong> - activate emergency mode
            <br /><strong>/carsu</strong> - declare a vehicle in pursuit</p>
            

